pen a web browser and go to `http://127.0.0.1:5000/` to view the application.\n\n### Testing the Application\n- To test data fetching:\n  ```bash\n  python test_fetch_data.py\n  ```\n\n## Conclusion\nThis application provides a basic framework for fetching and processing data within a Flask web server. Use this manual to set up and run the application efficiently.\n', 'encoding': 'utf-8', 'mode': 'overwrite'}, 'stage': 'before'} 
