n\\n2. **Install Dependencies**:\\n   ```bash\\n   pip install -r requirements.txt\\n   ```\\n\\n## How to Use\\n\\n### Running the Server\\n1. Navigate to the project directory.\\n2. Run the main module to start the server:\\n   ```bash\\n   python main.py\\n   ```\\n3. Open a web browser and go to `http://127.0.0.1:5000/` to view the application.\\n\\n### Testing the Application\\n- To test data fetching:\\n  ```bash\\n  python test_fetch_data.py\\n  ```\\n\\n## Conclusion\\nThis application provides a basic framework for fetching and processing data within a Flask web server. Use this manual to set up and run the application efficiently.\\n","encoding":"utf-8","mode":"overwrite"}'}}]}, {'role': 'tool', 'content': '{\n  "path": "my_project/manual.md",\n  "absolute_path": "C:\\\\Users\\\\lucag\\\\SwarmDev_Parallel\\\\ChatDev\\\\WareHouse\\\\Hybrid_Images_20260531134004\\\\code_workspace\\\\my_project\\\\manual.md",\n  "size": 2011\n}', 'tool_call_id': 'call_m5vy3sme592TjYsvfhddLaQS', 'metadata': {'tool_name': 'save_file', 'source': 'Chief Product Officer'}}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'type': 'text', 'text': "I've created a detailed user manual for the Python-based solution. You can find it in the `my_project` directory as `manual.md`. This manual includes an introduction to the software, main functions, installation instructions, and usage guidelines. Let me know if there's anything else you need!"}], 'metadata': {'source': 'Chief Product Officer'}}], 'context_trace_complete': True}}], 'node_type': 'agent', 'input_count': 3, 'predecessors': ['Manual Phase Prompt for User', 'USER', 'Chief Product Officer'], 'successors': ['Manual Phase Loop Counter', 'Chief Product Officer']} 
